{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Queen's Cards: Demo</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Queen's Cards</strong> is a satisfying roguelike deck-building tower defense game where you must build your deck, manage your economy, and strategically defend your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine powerful passive and active cards, build unique towers, deploy soldiers, and find synergies that suit your preferred playstyle.<br>Whether you focus on overwhelming firepower, smart economy, or strategic placement \u2014 the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udccf What\u2019s Included in the Demo:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through <strong>30 waves</strong> of enemies on a handcrafted map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>around 40 cards</strong>, including towers, soldiers, economy tools, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore early-stage synergies and card combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your region using tower placements and economy management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd12 <strong>Note</strong>: The full game will include multiple maps, hundreds of cards, skill trees, and long-term progression systems.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647840?t=1747434509","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647840?t=1747434509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647840/ba3889654ab53c5087b7369307061b25f6b15e79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747434509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647840/ba3889654ab53c5087b7369307061b25f6b15e79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747434509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_